+def headline_numbers_said(run_dir):
+    """Claude-gates T13: every number in the headline the drop shows (caption story line, suggested title) is said
+    in the video: it occurs in the locked sentences of the hook or a clip (canon form). Returns the numbers that
+    are not."""
